    "title": "第5章 予想の彼方に見るもの",
    "enTitle": "Chapter 5: What Lies Beyond Predictions",
    "text": [
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "",
            "jpText": "ある日の放課後。図書室で、クロノジェネシスと\n彼女を遠くから見つめるウマ娘を見かけた。",
            "enText": "One day after school. In the library, I spotted Chrono Genesis and another horsegirl watching her from a distance.",
            "nextBlock": 2,
            "origClipLength": 101,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 120,
                    "pathId": -9202641391231905050
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8614882748640107160,
            "blockIdx": 1
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノのクラスメイト",
            "enName": "Chrono's Classmate",
            "jpText": "うーん……。やっぱり、今のクロノちゃんって……。",
            "enText": "Ugh… Just as I thought, Chrono is currently…",
            "nextBlock": 3,
            "origClipLength": 167,
            "voiceIdx": 0,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "クロノに用事かな？",
                    "enText": "<size=40>Do you have some business with Chrono?</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 3
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -3278034490345410054
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3129064661109699004,
            "blockIdx": 2
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノのクラスメイト",
            "enName": "Chrono's Classmate",
            "jpText": "クロノちゃんの……。はい、テスト用のノートを返しに来たんです。\n綺麗にまとまっててすごく助かったので、お礼を言いたくて……。",
            "enText": "Oh, you are Chrono's… Yes, I'm here to give her back the test notes I borrowed. They were so beautifully organized, so I just wanted to say thanks…",
            "nextBlock": 4,
            "origClipLength": 352,
            "voiceIdx": 1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 102,
                    "pathId": -8455214084663820084
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8773508566552303740,
            "blockIdx": 3
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノのクラスメイト",
            "enName": "Chrono's Classmate",
            "jpText": "でも、今のクロノちゃん、すっごく集中してるというか……。\nいつものお淑やかな感じとは違ったオーラを放ってて……。",
            "enText": "But Chrono right now, she seems so incredibly focused… \nLike she's exuding an aura that's completely different from her usual, gentle self…",
            "nextBlock": 5,
            "origClipLength": 345,
            "voiceIdx": 2,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 183,
                    "pathId": -4697292521090887185
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 51,
                    "pathId": 4011815147968371019
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -6712432906684689323,
            "blockIdx": 4
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノのクラスメイト",
            "enName": "Chrono's Classmate",
            "jpText": "ちょっとお邪魔になっちゃいそうで、声かけづらいっていうか……\nだけど、私、これから用事があるし……どうしよう？",
            "enText": "I feel like I'd be disturbing her, so it's hard to speak up… but I have something else to do after this… what should I do?",
            "nextBlock": 6,
            "origClipLength": 352,
            "voiceIdx": 3,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "それなら、俺が預かって渡しておくよ",
                    "enText": "I'll hold onto it for you and give it to her",
                    "nextBlock": 6
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "それなら、私が預かって渡しておくよ",
                    "enText": "I'll hold onto it for you and give it to her",
                    "nextBlock": 6
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 18,
                    "pathId": -6003242922575529189
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 2510704873704186765,
            "blockIdx": 5
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "今回はダート1700、右回り……。注目を集めてるのは10番……。\n確かに、前走逃げ切り勝ちした先行力は目が離せない……。",
            "enText": "This time it's 1700m on dirt, clockwise… #10 drawing a lot of attention… It's true, you can't take your eyes off that front-running power from their wire-to-wire win in the last race…",
            "nextBlock": 7,
            "origClipLength": 362,
            "voiceIdx": 4,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ねえねえ、クロノ",
                    "enText": "Hey, Chrono",
                    "nextBlock": 7
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 291,
                    "pathId": -6430742578494485425
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 267,
                    "pathId": 5222196592772415508
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4032971502441677974,
            "blockIdx": 6
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "けど、私が注目するのは6番……。ここ数戦は振るわないながら\n今回は距離短縮に加えて、バ場状態も――",
            "enText": "But the one I'm keeping an eye on is #6… Even though they haven't been performing well in their last few races, this time they've got a shorter distance, and the track conditions—",
            "nextBlock": 8,
            "origClipLength": 321,
            "voiceIdx": 5,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "もしも～し？",
                    "enText": "Hello～?",
                    "nextBlock": 8
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 182,
                    "pathId": 1209488820222961538
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": -7501763046790600655
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 115,
                    "pathId": -4768220597883045704
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 133,
                    "pathId": 3749576123482913649
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -122938221876479273,
            "blockIdx": 7
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "ひゃ……！　と、トレーナーさん……。\nい、い、いつのまに……。",
            "enText": "Hya…! T-Trainer… \nH-H-How long have you been there…?",
            "nextBlock": 9,
            "origClipLength": 196,
            "voiceIdx": 6,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 210,
                    "pathId": -894752390341427882
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 25,
                    "pathId": 2259532460304958084
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 279,
                    "pathId": -7432878343870003478
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 258,
                    "pathId": -6055307349850062218
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 240,
                    "pathId": 4159767455820846906
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 328,
                    "pathId": -912737725020673540
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 4998506131582164803,
            "blockIdx": 8
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "そ、そうでしたか……。代わりにこれを……。",
            "enText": "I-I see… So you've brought this in her place…",
            "nextBlock": 10,
            "origClipLength": 164,
            "voiceIdx": 7,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 192,
                    "pathId": 2479862216556694817
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 79,
                    "pathId": 5125424242150169180
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": 2197393481491367809
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": -7378496991692151733
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": -2378955433534449136
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 15,
                    "pathId": 2248378457531848995
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 7898713109242454571,
            "blockIdx": 9
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "彼女には悪いことをしてしまいました……。\n予想を詰めていたら、つい夢中になってしまって……。",
            "enText": "I ended up doing something wrong to her… \nI was working on my predictions and just got completely lost in them…",
            "nextBlock": 11,
            "origClipLength": 282,
            "voiceIdx": 8,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "ちなみに、どのレースの予想をしていたの？",
                    "enText": "<size=40>By the way, Which race were you predicting?</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 11
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 317,
                    "pathId": 6236781768305756542
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 91,
                    "pathId": -5490537363029133705
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2111642369874550308,
            "blockIdx": 10
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "えと……今日の種目別競技大会です。大体の予想は立てられたので、\nあとは直接仕上がりを見て、精度を高めたいと……。",
            "enText": "Um… it's for today's race meet. I've finished most of my predictions, so now I want to see the participants' condition in person to improve my accuracy…",
            "nextBlock": 12,
            "origClipLength": 358,
            "voiceIdx": 9,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 321,
                    "pathId": 7164613565050507254
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 170,
                    "pathId": 3539819115820817117
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 6603157116201150674,
            "blockIdx": 11
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "あ……出走前のウォーミングアップ。\nそろそろ行かないと……！",
            "enText": "Ah… the pre-race warm-ups. I'd better get going now…!",
            "nextBlock": 13,
            "origClipLength": 182,
            "voiceIdx": 10,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "面白そうだから、俺も一緒に行くよ",
                    "enText": "Sounds fun. I'll go too.",
                    "nextBlock": 13
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "面白そうだから、私も一緒に行くよ",
                    "enText": "Sounds fun. I'll go too.",
                    "nextBlock": 13
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 89,
                    "pathId": 6172090306495725511
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 163,
                    "pathId": -8601734015575756479
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -7638906248303024605,
            "blockIdx": 12
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……6番の仕上がり……予想通り……。\n10番のトモの運び……うん。これなら……。",
            "enText": "…#6's condition… just as predicted… \n#10's hindquarter movement… yeah. With this…",
            "nextBlock": 14,
            "origClipLength": 291,
            "voiceIdx": 11,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "予想は決まった？",
                    "enText": "Have you made your final prediction?",
                    "nextBlock": 14
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": 3718705963073777253
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 30,
                    "pathId": 4116288825145251100
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 123,
                    "pathId": 6835946880106588053
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 33,
                    "pathId": 7855767199537103764
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 161,
                    "pathId": -8607145343264096123
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 179,
                    "pathId": 218869356766852403
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2715687349891794739,
            "blockIdx": 13
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "……はい。本命は6番。対抗で10番。\n1着は6番で堅く、10番、12番の2着争いが有力かと……！",
            "enText": "…Yes. The favorite is #6. The main rival is #10. First place is a lock for #6, and I believe the battle for second will likely be between #10 and #12…!",
            "nextBlock": 15,
            "origClipLength": 334,
            "voiceIdx": 12,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 191,
                    "pathId": 214763880567485047
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 210,
                    "pathId": 4116146186661239837
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": -7282922995319357257
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 20,
                    "pathId": 1743078574225832604
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 18,
                    "pathId": 4305912208527482204
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -1333798879374792153,
            "blockIdx": 14
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "Monologue",
            "jpText": "やがてウォーミングアップが終わり、\n選手たちが続々とゲートインする。だが――",
            "enText": "Before long, the warm-ups ended, and the athletes began entering their gates one after another. However—",
            "nextBlock": 16,
            "origClipLength": 94,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 153,
                    "pathId": -1415135071538275751
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 116,
                    "pathId": -4482423311270366469
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -5069656639563336471,
            "blockIdx": 15
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "Monologue",
            "jpText": "（ポツッ……ポツッ……）",
            "enText": "<i>(Drip… Drip…)</i>",
            "nextBlock": 17,
            "origClipLength": 60,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "（えっ！？雨……！？）",
                    "enText": "(Eh?! Rain…!?)",
                    "nextBlock": 17
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 23,
                    "pathId": -5525176126208030473
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 23,
                    "pathId": -1090584890249928443
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -8896301048393040570,
            "blockIdx": 16
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "Monologue",
            "jpText": "急速に雲が空を覆い、スタートと同時に雨が降り出した。\n観戦者たちが右往左往しながら屋根の下へと避難する。",
            "enText": "Clouds rapidly covered the sky, and rain began to pour just as the race started. Spectators scurried this way and that, seeking shelter under the roof.",
            "nextBlock": 18,
            "origClipLength": 112,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "……あれっ？クロノは？",
                    "enText": "…Huh? where's Chrono?",
                    "nextBlock": 18
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2861496940604527336,
            "blockIdx": 17
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "――6番は先行二番手……。重バ場で入着した経験もあるから、\n落ち着いた走り……。過去のレースから考えると……。",
            "enText": "—#6 is running second in the lead group… They have a history of placing in heavy track conditions, so they're running calmly… If I think about past races…",
            "nextBlock": 19,
            "origClipLength": 248,
            "voiceIdx": 13,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "クロノ、君も早く屋根の下へ……！",
                    "enText": "<size=38>Chrono, you should get under the roof too…!</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 19
                },
                {
                    "jpText": "クロノ、貴方も早く屋根の下へ……！",
                    "enText": "<size=38>Chrono, you should get under the roof too…!</size>",
                    "nextBlock": 19
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 268,
                    "pathId": -8272137188782841993
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 79,
                    "pathId": -2342968628265299022
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 5847800360832012037,
            "blockIdx": 18
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "いえ……！　ここです……！\n最前席がいいんです……！",
            "enText": "No…! This is the spot…! \nI have to be in the front row…!",
            "nextBlock": 20,
            "origClipLength": 87,
            "voiceIdx": 14,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": -5684928737232527503
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 107,
                    "pathId": -2503639282947121590
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4465016743809519309,
            "blockIdx": 19
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "かつての歴史にも、様々な雨中の激戦がありました……！\nこのレースも、いずれそのような一戦に繋がるかもと思うと――",
            "enText": "Even in past history, there have been all sorts of fierce battles fought in the rain…! When I think that this race, too, might one day lead to that kind of legendary clash—",
            "nextBlock": 21,
            "origClipLength": 273,
            "voiceIdx": 15,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 293,
                    "pathId": 6303120054661569027
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 201,
                    "pathId": 1975101240860009071
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 1276389517742642837,
            "blockIdx": 20
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "目を離したくは、ないのです……！！",
            "enText": "I don't want to take my eyes off it for a single second…!!",
            "nextBlock": 22,
            "origClipLength": 61,
            "voiceIdx": 16,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "クロノ……",
                    "enText": "Chrono…",
                    "nextBlock": 22
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 87,
                    "pathId": -6953760197498906869
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 93,
                    "pathId": -2628993730816870886
                }
            ],
            "pathId": 3481059811094004505,
            "blockIdx": 21
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "歴史とは“絵”です。レースに携わる全ての者たちが描いた数多の\n“点”が繋がり、線になることで浮かび上がる――巨大な一枚絵。",
            "enText": "History is a \"painting.\" It's a massive, single painting that emerges when the countless \"dots\" drawn by everyone involved in racing connect to form lines.",
            "nextBlock": 23,
            "origClipLength": 360,
            "voiceIdx": 17,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 87,
                    "pathId": -6441773916721435286
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 78,
                    "pathId": 636262106702819284
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 33,
                    "pathId": -914670444143323184
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -4651790350787699054,
            "blockIdx": 22
        },
        {
            "jpName": "モノローグ",
            "enName": "Monologue",
            "jpText": "以前、『歴史に魅入られた』と言っていた彼女。\n雨も厭わないこの情熱は、まさに魅入られたというべきもので――",
            "enText": "Before, she said she was <i>captivated by history</i>. This passion of hers, undeterred by the rain, was exactly what it meant to be captivated——",
            "nextBlock": 24,
            "origClipLength": 114,
            "voiceIdx": -1,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 318,
                    "pathId": -1072338739590115456
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3865867357797979697,
            "blockIdx": 23
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "えっ、ここで3番……！？\n6番の隙をついて……わっ！　わっ！",
            "enText": "Eh, #3 is making a move here…!? \nTaking advantage of #6's opening… Whoa! Whoa!",
            "nextBlock": 25,
            "origClipLength": 201,
            "voiceIdx": 18,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 60,
                    "pathId": 6068684714897478220
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 22,
                    "pathId": 3872579267184486933
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 50,
                    "pathId": -2505390995498970476
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -3551158436539487635,
            "blockIdx": 24
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "3番の……差し切り……！\n……すごい……！　すごい、すごいっ！！",
            "enText": "#3's… final surge…! \n…Amazing…! Amazing, amazing!!",
            "nextBlock": 26,
            "origClipLength": 235,
            "voiceIdx": 19,
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 76,
                    "pathId": 3687672034151423620
                },
                {
                    "origLen": 64,
                    "pathId": 5830633683656404706
                }
            ],
            "pathId": -2701668986566454538,
            "blockIdx": 25
        },
        {
            "jpName": "クロノジェネシス",
            "enName": "Chrono Genesis",
            "jpText": "6番も重バ場の適性があったはず……！\nなのに、こちらの予想を覆して……はっ。この展開、確か……！！",
            "enText": "#6 was supposed to have the aptitude for a heavy track too…! And yet, they overturned all of my expectations… Ha. This development, if I recall…!!",
            "nextBlock": 27,
            "origClipLength": 324,
            "voiceIdx": 20,
            "choices": [
                {
                    "jpText": "あっ、クロノ！",
                    "enText": "",
                    "nextBlock": 27
                }
            ],
            "animData": [
                {
                    "origLen": 58,
                    "pathId": 44663143732032067
                },
